  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><br></div></div><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 155%; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 155%; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1123%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20180415115549&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile279.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F9928F0335AD2BF30308582')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 지평선변화시킬수있는천구모형.hwp</a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 155%; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 155%; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">초간단 천구모형 만들기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">간단한 천구모형들은 시중에 많이 나와 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">중심에 지구가 있고 주변에 천구가 있는 모형은 많지만 지평선을 변화시키고 천구운동을 관찰할 수 있는 모형은 많지 않다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">예전에는 둥근플라스크에 물을 넣고 둥근 플라스크를 회전시키면서 물표면을 지평선이라고 가정하고 별의 일주운동을 설명한 적이 있었다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; clear: none; float: none; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"width: 568px; height: auto; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img width=\"568\" height=\"188\" style=\"height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/tistory/99CB094B5AD2BC002B\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 5.png\" srcset=\"//img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1920x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile28.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99CB094B5AD2BC002B5AD3 1920w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R960x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile28.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99CB094B5AD2BC002B5AD3 960w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R720x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile28.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99CB094B5AD2BC002B5AD3 720w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R640x0.q70/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile28.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99CB094B5AD2BC002B5AD3 640w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R480x0.q70/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile28.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99CB094B5AD2BC002B5AD3 480w\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">둥근플라스크의 각도를 바꾸면 자연스럽게 지평선이 바뀌면서 다양한 위도에 따른 별의 일주운동을 관찰할 수 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">하지만 영구적으로 만들 수 없고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">물을 사용하므로 불편한 점이 많았다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">그래서 쉽게 지평선을 변화시킬 수 있는 초간단 천구모형을 제작해 보았다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; clear: none; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; float: none; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"width: 478px; height: auto; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img width=\"478\" height=\"239\" style=\"height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/tistory/99E4F6505AD2BB2F1E\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 1.png\" srcset=\"//img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1920x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile27.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99E4F6505AD2BB2F1E0CF5 1920w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R960x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile27.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99E4F6505AD2BB2F1E0CF5 960w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R720x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile27.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99E4F6505AD2BB2F1E0CF5 720w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R640x0.q70/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile27.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99E4F6505AD2BB2F1E0CF5 640w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R480x0.q70/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile27.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99E4F6505AD2BB2F1E0CF5 480w\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">가</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">관련단원 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">중학교 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">학년 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">단원 태양계</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">나</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">준비물</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">투명공 원 지름 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">8cm </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">네오디움 자석</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">원형사리 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">12*3T </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">내경 외경</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">3.5*6.2)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">나무젓가락</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">도화지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">투명테이프</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">싸인펜</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">칼</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">가위</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">종이컵</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">지름</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">7.3cm), </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">압정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조