e=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">변경하고 아래쪽에 자석을 붙여 고정시킨다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">그리고 지평선을 돌려 동서남북 방위를 맞추면 준비 끝</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">투명한 반구를 사용하기 때문에 손으로 들고 관측자 위치에서 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">북극성 고도 알아내기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">지평선의 위치를 바꾸어 가며 북극성의 고도와 위도와의 관계 확인하기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">위도에 따른 별의 일주 운동</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">위쪽 <strong><u><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">투명반구를 반시계방향으로 회전시켜</span></u></strong> 가며 저위도</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">중위도</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">고위도에서 보이는 별의 일주운동 관찰</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">투명반구를 통해서 관측자 위치에서 동</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">서</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso