 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">남위 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">23.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">도는 위쪽 투명반구에 스카치테이프를 길게 붙여서 구현</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">태양 위치에서 후레시를 비춰가며 그림자 길이 변화 관찰</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">낮과 밤의 길이가 변하는 것 관찰</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">내행성이 초저녁과 새벽에 보이는 이유 설명</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">태양 주위에 내행성 궤도 부착</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">마</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">응용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">태양을 스카치테이프에 표시하고 스카치테이프 한쪽 끝을 말아 넣어서 쉽게 뗄 수 있게 하면 붙였다 떼었다 하면서 관찰가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">스카치테이프 대신 작은 스티커로 별자리 표현하게 할 수도 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">북극성 위치에는 송곳으로 구멍 뚫고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">이쑤시개나 실핀을 넣었다 뺐다 할 수 있게 제작하여 북극성 고도 측정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">반구 아래쪽에 각도를 표시해 놓으면 지평선 위도를 쉽게 알 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">5) </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">관측자 위치에 다양한 인형을 만들어 세워두게 하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">지평선도 건물이나 숲등을 만들어 붙여 꾸미게 할 수 있음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">그밖에 천구 관련 추가 실험</span