<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">거리에 따른 별의 밝기 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">일정한 화면에 표시된 점의 개수를 이용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">별의 등급 간접 비교</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">모든 별의 밝기가 같은 것은 아니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">블랙홀이 지나가는지 확인하는 방법 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-far